Description: Implement per-client packet queue fanout in PhoneAPI and MeshService.
 Multiple concurrent clients (e.g. mobile phone app on TCP port 4403 and Web UI
 on HTTP port 9443) each receive independent copies of packets destined for the
 phone, preventing packet starvation where one client steals all incoming packets.
 Note: relates directly to upstream Meshtastic issue #9776 / PR #9627.
